            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">Quiz: Gospel at Colonus</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Distinguishing landmark productions</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">GOSPEL AT COLONUS (1983)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Director: Lee Breuer</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Source: Oedipus at Colonus (the sequel)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Form: Black Pentecostal church service</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"410\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Morgan Freeman, Blind Boys of Alabama, Clarence Fountain</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"460\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"510\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">DARKER FACE OF THE EARTH (1994)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"560\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Author: Rita Dove</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"605\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Setting: Antebellum South Carolina plantation</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"640\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Distinct from Breuer.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"690\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"740\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">STRATFORD (1957)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"790\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Director: Tyrone Guthrie</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"835\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Form: Masks, stylized ritual movement</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"870\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Filmed; canonical mid-century staging.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"920\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"970\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"22\">Each production answers a different question</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"22\">about how to make Greek tragedy now.</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Three landmark productions, three different answers."
