          "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">The Mask Question</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Four directorial approaches</text><path d=\"M 550 165 C 480 165 445 205 445 260 C 445 320 490 360 550 360 C 610 360 655 320 655 260 C 655 205 620 165 550 165 Z\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M 495 245 Q 515 230 535 245\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M 565 245 Q 585 230 605 245\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M 505 305 Q 550 335 595 305\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">prosopon: fixed face, projecting voice</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"430\" width=\"460\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. FULL RECONSTRUCTION</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"518\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Restore masks for ritual power.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"553\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Gain: estrangement, grandeur.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"588\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Risk: museum-piece distance.</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"430\" width=\"460\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. ABANDONMENT</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"518\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Naturalistic, unmasked faces.</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"553\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Gain: psychological immediacy.</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"588\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Cost: ritual becomes realism.</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"630\" width=\"460\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"675\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. PARTIAL MASKING</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"718\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Half-masks, paint, chorus mask.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"753\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Mask assumed at key moments.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"788\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Convention plus human expression.</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"630\" width=\"460\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"675\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">4. REINVENTION</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"718\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Modern political staging.</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"753\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Video, mics, direct address.</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"788\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Downfall as breaking news.</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"830\" width=\"960\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"878\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">YOUR DIRECTOR'S CONCEPT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"21\">A fixed face that cannot see and cannot change,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"962\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"21\">worn by a man who cannot see or change his fate.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"998\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">To solve the mask problem is to interpret the play.</text></svg>",
          "caption": "Four ways to stage the mask, from full reconstruction to modern reinvention; each is an interpretation."
